	(text "Implement as part of the Rocket's state estimation solution. The Barometer provides low frequency, absolute altitude\nestimates to correct error that accumulates from the gyroscope and accelerometer estimates.\nChoose a part that is common and well known for these applications. It should communicate\nvia either I2C or SPI and should be rated for the g forces our rocket will experience."
